OL,3,GNEWSAPublic inquiry to look at
OL,4,Aimmigration centre plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere will be a public inquiry into
OL,7,Fgovernment plans to more than double
OL,8,Fthe capacity of an immigration removal
OL,9,Fcentre.
OL,11,FCampsfield near Kidlington in
OL,12,FOxfordshire reopened in December after
OL,13,Fit was shut in 2018 following years of
OL,14,Fproblems, including riots, escapes and
OL,15,Fcomplaints about conditions.
OL,17,FThe Home Office is proposing to
OL,18,Fincrease the centre's capacity from 160
OL,19,Fbed spaces to 400, and convert existing
OL,20,Fbuildings.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
