OL,4,Aimmigration centre plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Planning Inspectorate has now said
OL,7,Fthe application, submitted in June,
OL,8,Fwill follow an inquiry procedure. A
OL,9,Fdate has not yet been set.
